  <notepads>
    <notepad>
      <note>WF-load_ods
Converts staging into the ODS tables (one per subject, all hospitals together).
First empties the ODS tables and adm.ods_load_reject. Reference tables are not touched.
Check afterwards: SELECT * FROM adm.load_reconciliation (unexplained_rows must be 0).</note>
      <markdown>N</markdown>
      <notetype>GENERAL</notetype>
